.. title::  Résumé de l’évènement

This HPC@Maths seminar is somewhat special, as it will be held jointly with the ANANKE team and will aim to foster exchanges around our respective areas of expertise. It will consist of a presentation by each team, introducing our respective research themes as well as our technical expertise.

Both teams, characterized in particular by a strong presence of research engineers, share common interests and complementary skills, as evidenced by the informal discussions we have already had.

With the objective of initiating concrete collaborations, this joint seminar will follow the format below:

- 15 minutes dedicated to the presentation of scientific research themes
- 15 minutes devoted to software development and technical expertise

The seminar will conclude with an open discussion session.